# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# power.emersoneims.com  ->  www.emersoneims.com
#
# Place this file at the PUBLISH ROOT of the Netlify site that serves
# power.emersoneims.com (alongside index.html), then redeploy.
#
# WHY
# The subdomain serves 1,157 crawlable, self-canonical URLs selling the same
# generators, in the same market, as www. Google must choose between the two
# for every query, and every backlink either site earns is split. Consolidating
# hands all of that authority to one domain.
#
# WHY PAGE-TO-PAGE AND NOT A BLANKET REDIRECT TO THE HOMEPAGE
# Google treats "everything -> /" as a soft 404: the destination does not answer
# what the URL promised, so the authority being consolidated is discarded
# instead. Every rule below lands on a page about the same subject.
#
# 301! is a FORCED permanent redirect. The "!" matters: without it Netlify
# serves an existing file in preference to the rule, and every one of these
# paths has a real .html file behind it.
#
# ORDER IS SIGNIFICANT — Netlify takes the FIRST match. Specific paths first.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Blog: the genuinely useful content ─────────────────────────────────────
