# ── Homepage, then everything else ─────────────────────────────────────────
# ORDER MATTERS: the bare "/" rule must come BEFORE the catch-all or it is
# unreachable — Netlify takes the first match.
#
# The catch-all deliberately does NOT carry :splat. www has no equivalent of
# /some-old-page.html, so preserving the path would redirect straight into a
# 404 — worse than the homepage, which at least answers.
/                              https://www.emersoneims.com/                                  301!
/*                             https://www.emersoneims.com/                                  301
